<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-PSV SIGN ROMANIAN MIDFIELDER STINGA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PSV SIGN ROMANIAN MIDFIELDER STINGA.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch league leaders PSV Eindhoven said on Sunday they had signed Romanian midfielder Ovidiu Stinga from Spanish second division side Salamanca</p>
<p>PSV chairman Harry van Raay told Dutch radio the 24-year-old international midfielder had signed a contract with the club until July 2001.</p>
<p>Van Raay did not disclose the transfer fee.</p>
